; FILED: an exact bignum division that does not divide evenly loses exactness
; on the VM. Native carries a bignum numerator through the rational tower;
; the VM's VmRational is int64/int64, so it cannot represent the result and
; falls back to the correctly-rounded double.
; native -r : 1267650600228229401496703205376/3
; vm        : 4.2255020007607644e+29
; Even divisions ARE exact on both (see corpus/37_float_div_zero.esk), and the
; VM no longer returns 0 for a bignum division (vm_bignum_arith case '/').
(display (/ (expt 2 100) 3))
(newline)
